    return [
    ['jawai-safari-price-per-person-per-jeep-explained', 'Jawai Safari Price: What Decides the Cost per Jeep and per Person', 'Planning', '',
     'Why Jawai safari prices differ so much between operators, and what to check before you compare quotes.',
     'Jawai Safari Price: What Decides the Cost Per Jeep and Person',
     'Understand how Jawai leopard safari prices work: private jeep vs shared, duration, tracker, season and what is included, so you can compare quotes fairly.',
     'Jawai safari price, Jawai safari cost per person, Jawai jeep safari rate, Jawai leopard safari charges, Jawai safari budget',
     'Search for “Jawai safari price” and you will find quotes that look wildly different. The number on its own tells you little, because operators include and exclude very different things.',
     [['Most prices are per jeep, not per person', 'A private open 4x4 usually carries up to six guests, so the rate is quoted per vehicle. A solo traveller pays for the whole jeep, while a family of five shares the same figure. Always ask whether a quote is per jeep or per head. || Some operators sell shared seats at a lower per-person rate. That can work for a single traveller, but you lose control over timing and pace.'],
      ['What moves the price up or down', '- Length of the drive: a standard drive of about three hours costs less than a half-day or full-day expedition. || - Season: winter weekends and holiday weeks are the busiest. || - Photography plans: a dedicated photography drive, with a smaller group, is usually priced higher. || - Vehicle and tracker: a trained local tracker and a well-kept jeep are part of the quality you pay for. || - Extras: entry or permit fees, pickup from the hotel, and refreshments can be included or billed separately.'],
      ['How to compare quotes fairly', 'Ask each operator the same questions: duration, vehicle type, maximum guests, whether a tracker is included, pickup and any fees. Cheaper is not better if the drive is short, the jeep is crowded or the guide is untrained. A good operator will explain the plan clearly and will not promise a sighting. || We share safari rates on enquiry, because they depend on the season and your plan. Send your dates and we will reply personally.']],
     [['Is the Jawai safari price per person or per jeep?', 'It is normally per private jeep, which carries up to about six guests. Shared-seat options exist at some places, so always ask which one a quote means.'],
