      ['Why not just pick the cheapest safari?', 'A very low price can mean a shared jeep, a short drive or an untrained guide. Value comes from a good tracker, a sensible route and a calm, small group.']], 'safari'],

    ['how-to-book-jawai-leopard-safari-step-by-step', 'How to Book a Jawai Leopard Safari: A Simple Step-by-Step Guide', 'Planning', '',
     'From choosing dates to confirming your slot: a clear walk-through of booking a Jawai leopard safari.',
     'How to Book a Jawai Leopard Safari: Step-by-Step Guide',
     'Step-by-step help for booking a Jawai leopard safari: choose dates, decide on drives, send a request, confirm the rate and prepare for the day.',
     'how to book Jawai safari, Jawai leopard safari booking, book Jawai safari online, Jawai safari booking process, Bera safari booking',
     'Booking a Jawai safari is easy once you know the order of things. Here is the process most guests follow, from first idea to the morning of the drive.',
     [['1. Choose your dates and how many drives', 'Pick the nights you will stay in Bera and decide how many drives you want. Three or four drives over two days give a fair chance of good sightings. Winter weekends and holidays fill first, so aim to book two to three weeks ahead, and earlier for New Year. || Not sure? Our guide to [how many safaris to plan](blog/jawai-leopard-safari-complete-guide) helps.'],
      ['2. Decide on the type of drive', '- A standard private jeep drive of about three hours, morning or evening. || - A photography drive with a smaller group and a slower pace. || - A longer half-day or full-day expedition. || - A village or wetland drive for birds and culture.'],
      ['3. Send a request and confirm the details', 'Use the [safari request form](book?type=safari) or message us on [WhatsApp](contact). Tell us your dates, group size, children’s ages and any special interest. We reply personally with availability and the final rate. No payment is taken online. || Before you agree, check what is included: duration, vehicle, tracker, pickup and any fees.'],
      ['4. Prepare for the day', 'Pack neutral clothes, layers for cold mornings, a hat and binoculars. See [what to pack](blog/what-to-pack-for-jawai-safari). Keep your photo ID handy and be ready at the agreed time. Drives start around first light and about 4:00 PM, depending on the season.']],
     [['How early should I book a Jawai safari?', 'Two to three weeks ahead is a good habit, and earlier for Christmas, New Year and long weekends. Last-minute slots are sometimes possible, so it is always worth asking.'],
