      ['What if I only have a weekend?', 'Then see our [2-day weekend plan](blog/weekend-trip-to-jawai-from-udaipur-jodhpur) for a shorter route.']], 'plan'],

    ['jawai-2-nights-3-days-relaxed-itinerary', '2 Nights 3 Days in Jawai: A Relaxed Itinerary for Leopards and Local Life', 'Itinerary', '',
     'A gentle three-day Jawai plan with three drives, time for village life and an easy pace.',
     '2 Nights 3 Days Jawai Itinerary: Relaxed Leopard Trip Plan',
     'A relaxed 2 nights 3 days Jawai itinerary with three safaris, village time, local food and easy travel from Udaipur or Jodhpur.',
