     'Two nights in Bera is the most popular choice for good reason. It fits a long weekend and leaves room for three drives.',
     [['Day 1: settle in and an evening drive', 'Arrive after an early start, have lunch, rest for a little and head out for the first evening drive. You will meet your tracker, learn the signs to look for and enjoy sunset over the hills.'],
