     [['How far is Jawai from Ahmedabad?', 'About 300 km by road, so around five to six hours each way.'],
      ['Is it a good weekend trip?', 'Yes, particularly with a Friday evening start or a Monday off. Two nights is ideal.'],
      ['Can I add Mount Abu?', 'Yes, it fits neatly on the return journey as a half-day stop.']], 'plan'],

    ['add-jawai-to-rajasthan-itinerary-udaipur-jodhpur', 'Add Jawai to a Rajasthan Itinerary: Udaipur, Jodhpur and Beyond', 'Itinerary', '',
     'Where Jawai fits in a classic Rajasthan tour and how to avoid doubling back.',
     'Add Jawai to a Rajasthan Itinerary Between Udaipur and Jodhpur',
     'Fit Jawai into a Rajasthan itinerary: the Udaipur to Jodhpur corridor, sample 7 and 10 day plans and tips to avoid backtracking.',
